WEBVTT

00:13:29.930 --> 00:13:31.890
But I can also promise you this.

00:13:31.932 --> 00:13:35.769
It will make you
and all the people around you

00:13:35.769 --> 00:13:40.190
feel really, really, really good.

00:13:41.692 --> 00:13:43.068
Thank you.

00:13:43.110 --> 00:13:49.408
(Applause and cheers)